is your example basically  &lt;script&gt;append a text node&lt;/script&gt;x -- are there two text nodes or one?
69b0d3dfe919a6b860a9fac82de52a7e: no, the crux is the line document.getElementById(&quot;foo&quot;).appendChild(document.createElement(&quot;span&quot;))
