when it comes to decisions like that. you think about your future not someone elses. you think about how it&apos;s going to affect you in the long run and if it&apos;s going to benefit you or bring you down. if it&apos;s something you truly want to do then you put your mind to it and you do it. If you&apos;re unsure then you don&apos;t try it. It has to be something you truly want.
