i guess it comes down to this neither of us knows if were ready for or even want love again right now but very much like each other, do i want to be with someone for like alone especially if there will be no sex i dont know, i do want to at least give it some more time to find out but im sick of not even knowing what i want
well thats your problem right there. it comes down to what you want. if you can figure out what you want and she provides what you want, then shes the girl for you. but you have to do you before you can do someone else.
well thanks for listening and offering your thoughts youve got a lot of living and loving ahead of you its a lot of crazy and seems so simple and clear at that age i remember
well thank you for your insight. i wish you the best of luck and happiness in every decision you make.
